<!--
  COURT-105 synthetic OOXML fixture (Flat OPC; Word opens this file directly).
  Modelled on the STRUCTURE observed in R03 state §4.1 (NSW Caselaw exports,
  O-C6, O-C7): a platform template with one style family, no live fields,
  real footnotes that mix record references, prose and report-first
